{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:57:38+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:57:38+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Elmos Semiconductor SE","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"Germany","city":"Leverkusen","website":"https://www.elmos.com","employees":1204,"summary":"Elmos Semiconductor SE develops, manufactures, and distributes microelectronic components and system parts, and technological devices in Germany, other European Union countries, the United States, Asia/Pacific, and internationally. The company provides motor control IC solutions, which includes stepper motor controller IC, brushless DC motor controller IC, and DC motor controller IC; sensor ICs, such as ultrasonic distance IC, sensor signal processor IC, integrated absolute pressure system IC, optical IR sensor IC, ToF imager, and passive infrared IC; and LED driver ICs, such as high voltage, liner LED, and LIN RGB controller ICs. It also offers DC/DC converter IC; low dropout (LDO) regulator; and interface ICs, which includes PSI5, LIN/CAN, and KNX transceiver. In addition, the company offers ASIC design, automotive safety IC, engine management IC, and relay driver ICs, as well as interface ICs, including PSI5 transceiver; LIN / CAN transceiver; and KNX transceiver. Further, it provides ambient light; electronic fuse controller; thermal management; and ultrasonic ranging solutions. The company serves automotive and non-automotive applications comprising smart home, industrial automation, robotics, and cybersecurity applications. The company was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Leverkusen, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Elmos Semiconductor SE développe, fabrique et distribue des composants microélectroniques et des pièces de système, ainsi que des dispositifs technologiques en Allemagne, dans d'autres pays d